{
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "comments": [
      "Holds the clock for the Yahoo probe (W23, step 1; .github/workflows/probe-yahoo.yml).",
      "It posts a workflow_dispatch and nothing else: a missed probe is a gap in a",
      "measurement, not an outage, so there is no wait, no check and no mail.",
      "",
      "Why it exists: GitHub's schedule never fired the probe. Its first weekday, 9 Nov",
      "2026, had no run by 23:00 UTC, 3 h 15 min after the cron's 19:45, and the two",
      "runs that day were dispatched by hand from a laptop.",
      "",
      "Why New York time: the questions are about the market's clock, not New",
      "Zealand's. 17:30 ET is after CME's close (17:00 ET) and before the next session",
      "opens (18:00 ET): is the day's bar the last trade or the settlement? 01:30 ET",
      "is after New York midnight: between 18:00 ET and midnight Yahoo writes the new",
      "session into the old day's bar (10 Nov 2026), so is the old day back, and with",
      "the settlement? Monday to Saturday, so that every weekday session is seen at",
      "both hours; Saturday 17:30 and Monday 01:30 are the weekend, kept for free.",
      "",
      "The token is a fine-grained PAT of its own, Actions: read and write on this",
      "repository alone (docs/ci_setup.md, 7a), separate from trigger-weekly-load's so",
      "that revoking one does not stop the other. It is a securestring: not in the",
      "deployment history, masked on GET, and secureData hides the run inputs.",
      "",
      "Temporary, like the probe: delete the workflow with probe-yahoo.yml, and revoke",
      "its token."
    ]
  },
  "parameters": {
    "workflowName": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "trigger-probe-yahoo"
    },
    "location": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "australiaeast"
    },
    "repository": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "AndRayFS/nz-fuel-price-azure-fabric"
    },
    "ref": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "main"
    },
    "githubToken": {
      "type": "securestring",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Fine-grained PAT on this repository alone, permission Actions: read and write; not trigger-weekly-load's."
      }
    }
  },
  "resources": [
    {
      "type": "Microsoft.Logic/workflows",
      "apiVersion": "2019-05-01",
      "name": "[parameters('workflowName')]",
      "location": "[parameters('location')]",
      "properties": {
        "state": "Enabled",
        "definition": {
          "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
          "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
          "parameters": {
            "githubToken": {
              "type": "securestring"
            },
            "dispatchUri": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "ref": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "triggers": {
            "Recurrence": {
              "type": "Recurrence",
              "recurrence": {
                "frequency": "Week",
                "interval": 1,
                "timeZone": "Eastern Standard Time",
                "startTime": "2026-11-10T00:00:00",
                "schedule": {
                  "weekDays": [
                    "Monday",
                    "Tuesday",
                    "Wednesday",
                    "Thursday",
                    "Friday",
                    "Saturday"
                  ],
                  "hours": [
                    1,
                    17
                  ],
                  "minutes": [
                    30
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "actions": {
            "Dispatch_the_probe": {
              "type": "Http",
              "runAfter": {},
              "inputs": {
                "method": "POST",
                "uri": "@parameters('dispatchUri')",
                "headers": {
                  "Accept": "application/vnd.github+json",
                  "Authorization": "Bearer @{parameters('githubToken')}",
                  "User-Agent": "nz-fuel-price-trigger-probe-yahoo",
                  "X-GitHub-Api-Version": "2022-11-28"
                },
                "body": {
                  "ref": "@parameters('ref')"
                }
              },
              "runtimeConfiguration": {
                "secureData": {
                  "properties": [
                    "inputs"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "outputs": {}
        },
        "parameters": {
          "githubToken": {
            "value": "[parameters('githubToken')]"
          },
          "dispatchUri": {
            "value": "[format('https://api.github.com/repos/{0}/actions/workflows/probe-yahoo.yml/dispatches', parameters('repository'))]"
          },
          "ref": {
            "value": "[parameters('ref')]"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputs": {
    "workflowName": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "[parameters('workflowName')]"
    }
  }
}
